  *    the verdict of CanMoveInRoomBSP with the reason. Returns 0 allowed, 1 a wall stops it (o1..o4 = wall P1.X, P1.Y, P2.X, P2.Y in roo units),
  *    2 a body stops it (o1 = object id, o2/o3 = its position), 3 no room data / bad arguments. The four o variables are passed with the * operator.
